  "about_item": [
    "Complete Pet Flea Comb Set for Daily Grooming：This versatile flea comb set includes 7 grooming tools: fine-tooth handle comb, Beizi comb, fence comb, double row flea comb, double-hole detangling comb, dense & wide tooth comb, and a gentle dog eye comb. Ideal as a flea comb for cats, flea comb for dogs, puppy comb, and pet comb for dogs, helping manage tangles, loose hair, and everyday coat care.",
    "Durable & Pet-Safe Materials：Made with premium stainless steel and lightweight flexible plastic, this cat flea comb and dog flea comb set is designed for durability and comfort. Smooth rounded teeth help glide through fur while supporting gentle grooming. All combs are washable for easy care—simply rinse and air dry after using your flea brush for dogs or flea brush for cat.",
    "Designed for Multiple Coat Types：Whether you need a flea comb for small dogs, a cat flea combs for indoor cats, or a grooming tool for thicker coats, this set covers it all. Stainless steel combs help lift debris, loose hair, and tangles, while plastic combs smooth fur and distribute natural oils. Suitable as a tick comb for dogs, flea comb cat, or general pet comb for dogs.",
    "Gentle Multi-Area Grooming Tools：The included dog tear stain comb, dog face comb, and eye comb for small dogs are designed for delicate areas like around the eyes, ears, and muzzle. Fine polished teeth help remove dirt and buildup while staying gentle on sensitive skin. A practical flea brush and grooming kit for complete coat maintenance.",
    "Comfortable Ergonomic Handling：Ergonomic grip design provides better control and comfort during grooming sessions. Each dog flea comb, cat flea brush, and flea comb for cats glides smoothly through the coat to reduce grooming time. Great for regular brushing, detangling, and maintaining a neat coat for cats, puppies, and small or medium dogs."
  ],
