        "title": "Inexpensive anti flea option for cats with allergies to topicals and/or collars",
        "text": "First time using this set on my cat and it works great so far. He's allergic to the topicals and collars so I'm hoping i can get him some comfort cause these horrible little things have been making him miserable for the past few days. For the first session today I pulled off a good bit more than I expected to and dipped the combs in warm water with lemon dawn since lemon is a natural deterrent. I'll be doing this as much as it takes til he's better and will continue maintenance sessions to keep them from coming back so if i run into durability issues I will update but as of right now I'm really happy these work for my little buddies sake!",
